-     the backbone as hub and each of the non-backbone areas as
-     spokes.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-3-11"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     The topology of the backbone dictates the backbone paths used
