-     New state:  Depends upon action routine.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-98"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-        Action:  Determine whether the neighboring router should
-                 still be adjacent.  If yes, there is no state change
-                 and no further action is necessary.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-99"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-                 Otherwise, the (possibly partially formed) adjacency
-                 must be destroyed.  The neighbor state transitions
-                 to 2-Way.  The Link state retransmission list,
-                 Database summary list and Link state request list
-                 are cleared of LSAs.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-100"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-      State(s):  Exchange or greater
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-101"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-         Event:  SeqNumberMismatch
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-102"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     New state:  ExStart
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-103"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-        Action:  The (possibly partially formed) adjacency is torn
-                 down, and then an attempt is made at
-                 reestablishment.  The neighbor state first
-                 transitions to ExStart.  The Link state
-                 retransmission list, Database summary list and Link
-                 state request list are cleared of LSAs.  Then the
-                 router increments the DD sequence number in the
-                 neighbor data structure, declares itself master
-                 (sets the master/slave bit to master), and starts
-                 sending Database Description Packets, with the
-                 initialize (I), more (M) and master (MS) bits set.
-                 This Database Description Packet should be otherwise
-                 empty (see Section 10.8).
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-104"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-      State(s):  Exchange or greater
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-105"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-         Event:  BadLSReq
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-106"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     New state:  ExStart
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-107"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-        Action:  The action for event BadLSReq is exactly the same as
-                 for the neighbor event SeqNumberMismatch.  The
-                 (possibly partially formed) adjacency is torn down,
-                 and then an attempt is made at reestablishment.  For
-                 more information, see the neighbor state machine
-                 entry that is invoked when event SeqNumberMismatch
-                 is generated in state Exchange or greater.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-108"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-      State(s):  Any state
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-109"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-         Event:  KillNbr
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-110"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     New state:  Down
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-111"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-        Action:  The Link state retransmission list, Database summary
-                 list and Link state request list are cleared of
-                 LSAs.  Also, the Inactivity Timer is disabled.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-112"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-      State(s):  Any state
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-113"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-         Event:  LLDown
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-114"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     New state:  Down
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-115"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-        Action:  The Link state retransmission list, Database summary
-                 list and Link state request list are cleared of
-                 LSAs.  Also, the Inactivity Timer is disabled.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-116"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-      State(s):  Any state
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-117"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-         Event:  InactivityTimer
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-118"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     New state:  Down
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-119"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-        Action:  The Link state retransmission list, Database summary
-                 list and Link state request list are cleared of
-                 LSAs.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-120"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-      State(s):  2-Way or greater
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-121"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-         Event:  1-WayReceived
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-122"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     New state:  Init
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-123"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-        Action:  The Link state retransmission list, Database summary
-                 list and Link state request list are cleared of
-                 LSAs.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-124"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-      State(s):  2-Way or greater
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-125"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-         Event:  2-WayReceived
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-126"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     New state:  No state change.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-127"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-        Action:  No action required.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-128"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-      State(s):  Init
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-129"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-         Event:  1-WayReceived
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-10-130"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     New state:  No state change.
-]]></artwork>
