       <name slugifiedName="name-ospf-data-formats">OSPF data formats</name>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-a-1"> This appendix describes the format of OSPF protocol packets and OSPF
- LSAs.  The OSPF protocol runs directly over the IP network layer.
- Before any data formats are described, the details of the OSPF
- encapsulation are explained.</t>
